TIA TMS 1.1: a new name and blue look. Open each class to see sessions, courseware (PDFs open inside the app), assessments, attendance and feedback. Learners can scan the class QR to check in, submit assessment files and send course feedback. Trainers can show the check-in QR, mark attendance and record results. Also new: sign in with a password, edit your profile, light or dark theme, and class reminders on the day of class.
